From e37de65226d562a2e2d42343cf8c648736ac9b76 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dynfer <denesius20@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 13:00:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] g0: provision BOOT0 option bytes before first firmware upload

Preserve the factory ROM session and enable nBOOT_SEL through its SPI loader before erasing main flash. Validate the G071 identity, option complements and recovery settings; retain every other option byte and require complete readback after reconnect.

Keep Atlas NRST pulled up through both firmware stages and use ROM Go for first startup. Cover provisioning, existing applications, rejected options, missing ACKs and transport cleanup with sanitizer tests.
